          ['Shulzhenko M. G., Olkhovskyi A. S., Derkach O. L. Vibrational Stresses in the Last-Stage Blades of a Powerful Steam Turbine Under Kinematic Excitation of Oscillations. Part 2. Investigation of System with Cyclic Symmetry Violations. Strength of Materials, 2024, vol. 56, no. 2, pp. 234–245.', 'https://doi.org/10.1007/s11223-024-00643-7'],
